    READ_LOGS, MODIFY_PHONE_STATE, STATUS_BAR, FORCE_STOP_PACKAGES, ...) are
    intentional and are granted only when the app is installed in priv-app with
    the matching privapp-permissions allowlist. At runtime the app gracefully
    degrades when these permissions are absent (see RomCapabilityProvider).
-->
